      "writtenOn": "2019-03-05T23:12:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Where do you see the SOP messages being prioritized over SOP_PRIME? Can you confirm with a PD capture (or by using a alternate mode dongle like HDMI) that we are still sending the SOP discover identity?\n\nI see pd_send_vdm() calling queue_vdm(), which then places the request into the vdo_data structure for the port.  The vdo_data structure won\u0027t be emptied until the next task loop iteration when pd_vdm_send_state_machine() runs.  I don\u0027t see a way for the SOP message to be sent.",
      "parentUuid": "f633e910_0c63980b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 3365,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 3368,
        "endChar": 38
      },
      "revId": "61eb416d3739eec94c645cfd4f51643dbddcf15a",
